DTEND:20260914T125343Z
SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:48:23 and reappears at 18:20:04 IST\, se
 en from Rourkela.\nThe Moon is 23° up in the WSW · daylight\, Sun +1°.\
 nTimes against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moo
 n's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Rourkela
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Rourkela
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
